WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,370
Is this thing expensive?

2
00:00:01,370 --> 00:00:02,370
It smells weird

3
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:03,370
Bought for you

4
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:05,370
Don't feel bad about Qian Changsheng

5
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:07,370
Our family now has food and money

6
00:00:07,370 --> 00:00:09,370
The house is also repaired for you

7
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,370
Don’t go into the mountains again, okay? I’m afraid.

8
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:14,370
The wild animals outside are all lighted up

9
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:15,370
I want you to live a good life

10
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:18,880
Don’t worry, you still have to go deeper.

11
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:31,080
I know it well

12
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,080
Don't be born

13
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,080
stay on kang

14
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:51,300
well done

15
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,300
Dare to think about my home tomorrow

16
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:59,040
Break your nest

17
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,040
I really want to go

18
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,040
The wolves ran away

19
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,040
Forget it

20
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,040
I'm too busy

21
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,040
Running away is also a hidden danger

22
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:05,070
She holds a grudge

23
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:06,070
Come back when I'm not at home

24
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:07,070
You and Niuniu can't handle it

25
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:08,070
Stop her nest

26
00:01:08,070 --> 00:01:10,070
This life is not easy

27
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:11,520
Optimistic about home

28
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,520
Don't open the door if anyone knocks.

29
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,220
I'll go back in the evening

30
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:15,220
be careful
